{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexistence is a <strong>Roguelike Tower Defense Deckbuilder</strong> where each run unfolds on a procedural hexagonal grid that you expand yourself. Build your defense by playing cards to place towers or cast spells while managing resources and adapting your strategy to increasingly demanding waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2b22 \u2b21 \u2b22 \u2b21\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/a6c29a9765fc1871ad71659c1384a83a.poster.avif?t=1772837817\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/a6c29a9765fc1871ad71659c1384a83a.webm?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/a6c29a9765fc1871ad71659c1384a83a.mp4?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23e3 \u2b21\u00a0<strong>Build your defense\u00a0</strong>\u2b21\u00a0\u23e3 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is the core of your strategy. Each card can be played by paying its cost to place towers, apply upgrades, or manipulate the terrain, or it can be recycled to generate resources that allow you to play other cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23e3 \u2b21\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Expand the terrain\u00a0</strong>\u2b21\u00a0\u23e3 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your terrain to begin the wave. You can strategically choose where the path will grow to alter the route of the mobs or open new expansion lines. The way you expand the terrain determines the efficiency of your towers and the rewards you obtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/d65b7646446c4e30d9ba0ed342bd842d.poster.avif?t=1772837817\" width=1170 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/d65b7646446c4e30d9ba0ed342bd842d.webm?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/d65b7646446c4e30d9ba0ed342bd842d.mp4?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23e3 \u2b21\u00a0<strong>Real\u2011time waves\u00a0</strong>\u2b21\u00a0\u23e3 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the wave, you can continue playing cards, casting spells, or recycling those you don\u2019t need to gain additional resources. Pressure increases progressively, forcing you to adjust your defense in real time and react to increasingly complex mob patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23e3 \u2b21\u00a0<strong>Collect your rewards\u00a0</strong>\u2b21\u00a0\u23e3 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, you\u2019ll earn rewards that may include tower upgrades, new cards, relics\u2026 Every choice influences how your deck evolves and the possibilities available for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Hexspire and restore the Ethereals emerging from the Aether!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dispel the Aether\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Channel the Elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore the Hexistence!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/0683f120920294a445a85f74945a0129.poster.avif?t=1772837817\" width=1170 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/0683f120920294a445a85f74945a0129.webm?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/0683f120920294a445a85f74945a0129.mp4?t=1772837817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2b22 \u2b21 \u2b22 \u2b21\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23e3 \u2b21\u00a0<strong>Features\u00a0</strong>\u2b21\u00a0\u23e3 </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Tower Defense Deckbuilder.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Card System:</strong> Each card can be played by paying its cost or recycled to obtain resources, which can then be used to play other cards. No dead hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Map Generation:</strong> Every run generates a different map. Choose strategically the path the Ethereals will take so your Towers can handle the upcoming waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexagonal grid and procedural terrain</strong> with dynamic routes. Each expansion alters the flow of the waves and enables highly replayable runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Four Elements:</strong> Time, Energy, Matter, and Space are interconnected and influence every aspect of Hexistence. Both Towers and Ethereals have four distinctive attributes, one for each element.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Ranking:</strong> Record your high score on a global leaderboard and compare your performance with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 100 cards and relics</strong> for deep deck customization \u2014 make every run unique to achieve the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore the Ethereals:</strong> Help the Ethereals enjoy the Restored Hexistence by dispelling the Aether within them</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras/a736ae2b57dc8adeae91df567bb42fb9.avif?t=1772837817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/extras_big/a736ae2b57dc8adeae91df567bb42fb9.webp?t=1772837817 width=1560 height=623 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2720820?t=1772837817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/19468549b6fb413229dd6f2cd285310ad165ed64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772837817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/d79879af808006a3095c60152a4f101a5fade91c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772837817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720820/d79879af808006a3095c60152a4f101a5fade91c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772837817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hexistence is a <strong>Roguelike Tower Defense Deckbuilder</strong> where each run unfolds on a procedural hexagonal grid that you expand yourself. Build your defense by playing cards to 